%2C100&amp;w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Rian-Johnson-Portrait.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=12.5%2C0%2C75%2C100&amp;w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Rian-Johnson-Portrait.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=12.5%2C0%2C75%2C100&amp;w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Rian-Johnson-Portrait.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=12.5%2C0%2C75%2C100&amp;w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Rian-Johnson-Portrait.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=12.5%2C0%2C75%2C100&amp;w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Rian-Johnson-Portrait.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=12.5%2C0%2C75%2C100&amp;w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Rian-Johnson-Portrait.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=12.5%2C0%2C75%2C100&amp;w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Rian-Johnson-Portrait.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=12.5%2C0%2C75%2C100&amp;w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Rian-Johnson-Portrait.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=12.5%2C0%2C75%2C100&amp;w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Rian-Johnson-Portrait.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=12.5%2C0%2C75%2C100&amp;w=2400 2400w" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Rian-Johnson-Portrait.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=12.5%2C0%2C75%2C100&amp;w=2400"></p><div><p>Johnson wanted to bring the look of his films to the look of his iPhone photos — and let everyone else give it a try, too.</p></div></div><div><div><div><p><img alt="After printing 40,000 whistles, this is the 3D printer I’d buy" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" sizes="100px" srcset="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=32 32w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=48 48w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=64 64w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=96 96w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=128 128w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=256 256w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=2400 2400w" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/bambu-p2s.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.659090909091%2C0%2C66.681818181818%2C100&amp;w=2400"></p></div><div><div><p><span><span>Review</span></span></p></div><p>One year later, the Bambu P2S Combo is the only 3D printer I can easily recommend.</p></div></div><div><div><p><img alt="How Remedy designed Control Resonant’s wildest mission: ‘Anything kind of goes’" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" sizes="100px" srcset="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=32 32w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=48 48w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=64 64w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=96 96w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=128 128w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=256 256w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=2400 2400w" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/CTRL_R_Key_Art_FINAL_4K-1.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=2400"></p></div><div><p>Time-travel stories are ‘illogical’ by nature. But for Resonant’s version to work, Remedy had to make the physical space a lot easier to follow.</p></div></div><div><div><p><img alt="My therapist thinks I should chuck the Amazon Bee Frontier out a window" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" sizes="100px" srcset="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/10/26881