6666666667%2C0%2C66.666666666667%2C100&amp;w=2400"></p></div><div><div><p><span><span>Optimizer</span></span></p></div><p>Filtering conversations and memories through AI is a reality-bending lesson in why intelligence can’t replace wisdom.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section><header><p></p><h2><span>Hey! Listen</span><span> / </span><span>The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time Switch 2 remake is upon us.</span></h2><p></p></header><div><div><p><img alt="The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time never gets old" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_02.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=7.8125%2C0%2C84.375%2C100&amp;w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_02.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=7.8125%2C0%2C84.375%2C100&amp;w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_02.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=7.8125%2C0%2C84.375%2C100&amp;w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_02.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=7.8125%2C0%2C84.375%2C100&amp;w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_02.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=7.8125%2C0%2C84.375%2C100&amp;w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_02.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=7.8125%2C0%2C84.375%2C100&amp;w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_02.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=7.8125%2C0%2C84.375%2C100&amp;w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/NS2_TheLegen