=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_02.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=2400 2400w" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_02.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=2400"></p><div><div><p><span><span>Review</span></span></p></div><p>The franchise has evolved since 1998, but the first 3D Zelda stands up incredibly well in its Switch 2 remake.</p></div></div><div><div><div><p><img alt="New Zelda and GTA represent a games industry that no longer exists" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" sizes="100px" srcset="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/10/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_01.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=32 32w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/10/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_01.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=48 48w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/10/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_01.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=64 64w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/10/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_01.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=96 96w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/10/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_01.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=128 128w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/10/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaofTime_scrn_01.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=21.875%2C0%2C56.25%2C100&amp;w=256 256w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/10/NS2_TheLegendofZeldaOcarinaof