ontent/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/liverewind.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=19.514563106796%2C0%2C60.970873786408%2C100&amp;w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/liverewind.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=19.514563106796%2C0%2C60.970873786408%2C100&amp;w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/liverewind.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=19.514563106796%2C0%2C60.970873786408%2C100&amp;w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/liverewind.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=19.514563106796%2C0%2C60.970873786408%2C100&amp;w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/liverewind.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=19.514563106796%2C0%2C60.970873786408%2C100&amp;w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/liverewind.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=19.514563106796%2C0%2C60.970873786408%2C100&amp;w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/liverewind.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=19.514563106796%2C0%2C60.970873786408%2C100&amp;w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/liverewind.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=19.514563106796%2C0%2C60.970873786408%2C100&amp;w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/liverewind.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=19.514563106796%2C0%2C60.970873786408%2C100&amp;w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/liverewind.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=19.514563106796%2C0%2C60.970873786408%2C100&amp;w=2400 2400w" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/liverewind.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=19.514563106796%2C0%2C60.970873786408%2C100&amp;w=2400"></p></div><div><p>The watchOS 27.3 beta adds Live Rewind and Siri Recap to the Apple Watch Series 12 and Ultra 4.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section><h2>Most Discussed</h2><ol><li><p>1</p></li><li><p>2</p></li><li><p>3</p></li><li><p>4</p></li><li><p>5</p></li></ol></section></div><div data-kicker-surface="translucent" data-kicker-header="blur" data-rail-slot="kicker" aria-hidden="false" data-kicker-rail="kicker"><header><div><p><span>The Kicker</span><span>November 7</span></p></div></header></div></div><div><div id="storyStream-panel" aria-labelledby="storyStream-tab" role="tabpanel"><div role="article" id="latest-dmcyOnF1aWNrUG9zdDoxMDI5NTA4"><div><p><img alt="Terrence O'Brien" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" width="34" height="34" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" srcset="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/02/TERRENCE_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=48 1x, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/02/TERRENCE_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96 2x" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/02/TERRENCE_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96"></p><p><span>Terrence O'Brien</span><span><time datetime="2026-11-07T17:15:00+00:00">Two hours ago</time></span></p></div><div><p>What classic should Nintendo remake next?</p><p><em><a href="https://www.theverge.com/games/1025415/the-legend-of-zelda-ocarina-of-time-review-nintendo-switch-2">Ocarina of Time</a></em> is one of the most storied installments not just in the Zelda franchise, but in Nintendo history, so it only makes sense that the company would eventually remaster it. Which got us wondering: are there other titles in the Nintendo back catalog that could use a remake — not a sequel — to usher them into the modern console age?</p></div></div><div id="latest-dmcyOnBvc3Q6MTAyMzIzMA=="><p><img alt="The UV-tracking Gem made me rethink how sunlight affects my health, not just my appearance" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" deco