.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=128 128w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=256 256w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=2400 2400w" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/KpopDemonHunters_ProRes422HQ_SDR_2ch_20250424.01_04_39_22.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=18.59375%2C0%2C62.8125%2C100&amp;w=2400"></p><div><p>The 4K Criterion Collection set is available to grab for $25.</p></div></div><div role="article" id="latest-dmcyOnF1aWNrUG9zdDoxMDI5MTk5"><div><p><img alt="Richard Lawler" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" width="34" height="34" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" srcset="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/RICHARD_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=48 1x, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/RICHARD_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96 2x" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/RICHARD_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96"></p><p><span>Richard Lawler</span><span><time datetime="2026-11-06T21:04:01+00:00">Nov 6</time></span></p></div><div><p>Microsoft is reportedly “winding down” a cloud AI deal with Oracle.</p><p>For your “is that a bubble popping?” Bingo cards: <a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-06/microsoft-is-winding-down-oracle-deal-to-rent-ai-cloud-capacity">Bloomberg reports</a> that Microsoft is reconsidering deals to rent server capacity from “<a href="https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1014045/coreweave-stock-debt-sector-ai">neoclouds</a>” to power its AI efforts, and has been turning off rented capacity from <a href="https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/920378/oracle-openai-datacenter-buildout">Oracle</a> since declining to <a href="https://www.theverge.com/2023/11/7/23951639/microsoft-is-now-using-some-oracle-infrastructure-to-help-with-bing-chat">renew a 2023 deal</a>.</p><p>Sources said the computing power Oracle offered used older Nvidia chips, and had become less useful to Microsoft.</p></div></div><div role="article" id="latest-dmcyOnF1aWNrUG9zdDoxMDI5MTQ0"><div><p><img alt="Jay Peters" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" width="34" height="34" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" srcset="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/JAY_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=48 1x, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/JAY_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96 2x" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/JAY_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96"></p><p><span>Jay Peters</span><span><time datetime="2026-11-06T20:16:27+00:00">Nov 6</time></span></p></div><div><p>*Link rolling noises.*</p><p>Nintendo <a href="https://www.theverge.com/games/1025376/keep-on-rolling">added a sprint button</a> to the <em>Ocarina of Time</em> remake so you wouldn’t have to spam the roll button, but people have <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/NintendoSwitch2/comments/1xpl9c7/you_can_roll_faster_in_ocarina_by_canceling_with/">already found a roll spam</a> that seemingly is faster anyway. My hands hurt just watching this.</p></div></div><div id="latest-dmcyOnN0cmVhbTo5MDI1NDY="><p><img alt="All the latest updates on AI data centers" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" sizes="100px" srcset="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/04/STKS528_DATA_CENTERS_C.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.666666666667%2C0%2C66.666666666667%2C100&amp;w=32 32w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/04/STKS528_DATA_CENTERS_C.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.666666666667%2C0%2C66.666666666667%2C100&amp;w=48 48w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/04/STKS528_DATA_CENTERS_C.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.666666666667%2C0%2C66.666666666667%2C100&amp;w=64 64w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/04/STKS528_DATA_CENTERS_C.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.666666666667%2C0%2C66.666666666667%2C100&amp;w=96 96w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/04/STKS528_DATA_CENTERS_C.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.666666666667%2C0%2C66.666666666667%2C100&amp;w=128 128w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/04/STKS528_DATA_CENTERS_C.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.666666666667%2C0%2C66.666666666667%2C100&amp;w=256 256w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/04/STKS528_DATA_CENTERS_C.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.666666666667%2C0%2C66.666666666667%2C100&amp;w=376 376w, https://platfo