y=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=48 1x, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/JAY_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96 2x" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/JAY_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96"></p><p><span>Jay Peters</span><span><time datetime="2026-11-06T16:50:21+00:00">Nov 6</time></span></p></div><div><p>Apple Music Classical has a new logo, too.</p></div><div><div><p><a href="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0,0,100,100" data-pswp-height="1194" data-pswp-width="1480" rel="noreferrer"><img alt="A screenshot of the Apple Music Classical App Store listing." data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 100vw, (max-width: 1023px) 50vw, 700px" srcset="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=256 256w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=2400 2400w" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-06-at-8.44.34-AM.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=2400"></a></p></div><p><cite>Screenshot by Jay Peters / The Verge</cite></p></div></div><div role="article" id="latest-dmcyOnF1aWNrUG9zdDoxMDI4NzUz"><div><p><img alt="Jay Peters" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" width="34" height="34" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" srcset="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/JAY_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=48 1x, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/JAY_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96 2x" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/JAY_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96"></p><p><span>Jay Peters</span><span><time datetime="2026-11-06T16:40:49+00:00">Nov 6</time></span></p></div><div><p>The Ratchet &amp; Clank mobile game has been canceled.</p><p><em>Ratchet &amp; Clank: Ranger Rumble</em> will get <a href="https://www.rangerrumble.com/">its final update today</a>, be removed from app stores on November 21st, and be shut down entirely on May 1st. The game soft-launched in 2025, and earlier this year, its developers opened pre-registrations for an anticipated full launch, <a href="https://www.pushsquare.com/news/2026/11/sonys-killing-this-ratchet-and-clank-game-before-it-even-comes-out">according to <em>PushSquare</em></a>.</p></div></div><div id="latest-dmcyOnBvc3Q6MTAyODM3Mg=="><p><img alt="Meta’s refurbished Quest 3S headset is nearly $100 off right now" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" sizes="100px" srcset="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Verge-Deals-Meta-Quest-3S.webp?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.666666666667%2C0%2C66.666666666667%2C100&amp;w=32 32w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Verge-Deals-Meta-Quest-3S.webp?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.666666666667%2C0%2C66.666666666667%2C100&amp;w=48 48w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Verge-Deals-Meta-Quest-3S.webp?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=16.666666666667%2C0%2C66.666666666667%2C100&amp;w=64 64w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/Verg